      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "n = 16, the factors will be betweem 1 and 8 (n/2) \n\n1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 = expecting 1 factor here 1 to become prime\nnumber\n\n  if we remove 1 then we are expecting 0 factors to become  a\nprime number so the condtion becomes \n    \n    i = 2; i <= n/2\n\n    and more optimized - i = 2; i <= sqrt(n)\n\n",
      "fontSize": 22.548902147360526,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "n = 16, the factors will be betweem 1 and 8 (n/2) \n\n1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 = expecting 1 factor here 1 to become prime number\n\n  if we remove 1 then we are expecting 0 factors to become  a prime number so the condtion becomes \n    \n    i = 2; i <= n/2\n\n    and more optimized - i = 2; i <= sqrt(n)\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
