      "text": "Check if a Number is Prime\n\nProblem - Given an integer N, determine whether it is a prime number.\n\nInput\n\nA single integer N.\n\nOutput\n\nPrint \"Prime\" if N is prime, otherwise print \"Not Prime\".\n\nExample\n\nInput\n\n29\n\nOutput\n\nPrime",
      "fontSize": 32.90213573000221,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Check if a Number is Prime\n\nProblem - Given an integer N, determine whether it is a prime number.\n\nInput\n\nA single integer N.\n\nOutput\n\nPrint \"Prime\" if N is prime, otherwise print \"Not Prime\".\n\nExample\n\nInput\n\n29\n\nOutput\n\nPrime",
